      "text": "```\n:------------------------------------------------------------------:\n|              MODERN OLYMPIC HISTORY (1896-present)               |\n|                                                                  |\n|  PHASE 1: REVIVAL         PHASE 2: POLITICS      PHASE 3: MONEY  |\n|  (1896-1936)              (1936-1984)            (1984-present)  |\n|  -- Coubertin's ideal     -- Nazi propaganda     -- Ueberroth    |\n|  -- Amateurism enforced   -- Cold War proxy         model (LA84)|\n|  -- Small, Anglo-centric  -- Jesse Owens          -- Corporate   |\n|  -- Jim Thorpe stripped   -- Black Power salute     sponsorship  |\n|  -- Gender exclusion      -- Munich massacre       -- NBC deals  |\n|                           -- Boycotts             -- Dream Team  |\n|                           -- East German doping   -- Streaming   |\n|                                                                  |\n|  DOPING THREAD (continuous):                                     |\n|  Strychnine (1904) -> Amphetamines (1950s) -> Steroids (1960s)   |\n|  -> East German program (1970s) -> EPO (1990s) -> Biologicals    |\n|  -> WADA 1999 -> Biological Passport 2008 -> Russia 2014-2022    |\n:------------------------------------------------------------------:\n```"
    },
