      "text": "```\nATHENS 1896 — FACTS:\n  Host city: Athens, Greece\n  Dates: April 6-15, 1896\n  Nations: 14 (plus individual entrants)\n  Athletes: ~241 (all male)\n  Events: 43 (athletics, cycling, fencing,\n           gymnastics, shooting, swimming,\n           tennis, weightlifting, wrestling)\n  Venue: Panathenaic Stadium (rebuilt on\n          ancient site, Herodes Atticus financed\n          marble restoration)\n  Spectators: ~80,000 for major events"
